---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+13015550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(301) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Pilot Light Problems | Furnace Repair Laurel MD" description="Pilot light won't stay lit in Laurel, MD? Thermocouple and pilot assembly repair for older gas furnaces.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Pilot Light Issues in Laurel, MD</h1>
      <p>A pilot that won't stay lit is usually a thermocouple or pilot orifice problem — often a quick, affordable fix.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:1.25rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Fix It Today — {phoneDisplay}</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Why Pilots Fail</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Worn thermocouple</li>
        <li>Dirty pilot orifice</li>
        <li>Draft or venting problems</li>
        <li>Failing gas valve</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Modern furnaces use hot surface igniters instead of standing pilots. We service both styles.</p>
      <p><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Pilot Service</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
